#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:3
#: eeae4a223e694a51adec7ac49a66de6b
msgid "Config files"
msgstr "組態檔"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:7
#: 9ed9e991fd2148e29005023251b57534
msgid "This page is intended for advanced users."
msgstr "此頁面適用於進階使用者。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:10
#: 6be1deb22a1847c5878aec8944872910
msgid "Qubes-specific VM config files"
msgstr "Qubes 特定的 VM 組態檔"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:13
#: 5ef4bb56b8734eb382447e9cb5102852
msgid ""
"These files are placed in ``/rw``, which survives a VM restart. That way, "
"they can be used to customize a single VM instead of all VMs based on the "
"same template. The scripts here all run as root."
msgstr ""
"這些檔案放置在 ``/rw`` 中，該目錄在 VM 重新啟動後仍會保留。這樣一來，它們可以"
"用來自訂單個 VM，而不是基於相同範本的所有 VM。這裡的腳本都以 root 身分執行。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:15
#: 57feff245c2f41b0b0ebf12e329769c9
msgid ""
"``/rw/config/rc.local`` - script runs at VM startup. Good place to change "
"some service settings, replace config files with its copy stored in ``/rw/"
"config``, etc. The script need to have the executable permission set to be "
"executed. Example usage:"
msgstr ""
"``/rw/config/rc.local`` - 在 VM 啟動時執行的腳本。適合用來變更一些服務設定、"
"將組態檔替換為儲存在 ``/rw/config`` 中的副本等。腳本需要設定可執行權限才能被"
"執行。使用範例："

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:32
#: ff3867ad83ad49c48bf7fbfd45d34ec1
msgid ""
"``/rw/config/rc.local.d/*.rc`` - scripts run at VM startup just before ``/rw/"
"config/rc.local``"
msgstr ""
"``/rw/config/rc.local.d/*.rc`` - 在 VM 啟動時、緊接在 ``/rw/config/rc."
"local`` 之前執行的腳本"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:34
#: 58dd9fbdd0644e94bf75785a70396aba
msgid ""
"``/rw/config/rc.local-early.d/*.rc``, ``/rw/config/rc.local-early`` - "
"scripts similar to ``/rw/config/rc.local``, but running earlier in the "
"system startup sequence - just before ``sysinit.target``, and setting up the "
"network."
msgstr ""
"``/rw/config/rc.local-early.d/*.rc``、``/rw/config/rc.local-early`` - 與 ``/"
"rw/config/rc.local`` 類似的腳本，但在系統啟動序列中更早執行— 就在 ``sysinit."
"target`` 之前，並設定網路。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:36
#: 87343b29a77543a995fe33d46723fae2
msgid ""
"``/rw/config/qubes-ip-change-hook`` - script runs in NetVM after every "
"external IP change and on “hardware” link status change."
msgstr ""
"``/rw/config/qubes-ip-change-hook`` - 在 NetVM 中每次外部 IP 變更和「硬體」連"
"結狀態變更後執行的腳本。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:38
#: 75d8cc0d784b458293911119add8f02d
msgid ""
"In ProxyVMs (or app qubes with ``qubes-firewall`` service enabled), scripts "
"placed in the following directories will be executed in the listed order "
"followed by ``qubes-firewall-user-script`` at start up. Good place to write "
"custom firewall rules."
msgstr ""
"在 ProxyVM（或已啟用 ``qubes-firewall`` 服務的應用程式 qube）中，放置在以下目"
"錄中的腳本將在啟動時按列出的順序執行，然後接著執行 ``qubes-firewall-user-"
"script``。適合用來編寫自訂防火牆規則。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:48
#: 301a90e4ce36413baae24db4dcaa59cc
msgid ""
"``/rw/config/suspend-module-blacklist`` - list of modules (one per line) to "
"be unloaded before system goes to sleep. The file is used only in a VM with "
"PCI devices attached. Intended for use with problematic device drivers."
msgstr ""
"``/rw/config/suspend-module-blacklist`` - 要在系統進入睡眠前卸載的模組列表"
"（每行一個）。此檔案僅在用於附加了 PCI 裝置的 VM。適用於有問題的裝置驅動程"
"式。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:50
#: ca3330552b3d481b889f70b3a70338c3
msgid ""
"In NetVMs/ProxyVMs, scripts placed in ``/rw/config/network-hooks.d`` will be "
"ran when configuring Qubes interfaces. For each script, the ``command``, "
"``vif``, ``vif_type`` and ``ip`` is passed as arguments (see ``/etc/xen/"
"scripts/vif-route-qubes``). For example, consider a PV app qube ``work`` "
"with IP ``10.137.0.100`` and ``sys-firewall`` as NetVM. Assuming it’s Xen "
"domain id is arbitrary ``12`` then, the following script located at ``/rw/"
"config/network-hooks.d/hook-100.sh`` in ``sys-firewall``:"
msgstr ""
"在 NetVM/ProxyVM 中，放置在 ``/rw/config/network-hooks.d`` 中的腳本將在設定 "
"Qubes 介面組態時執行。對於每個腳本，``command``、``vif``、``vif_type`` 和 "
"``ip`` 會作為參數傳遞（請參閱 ``/etc/xen/scripts/vif-route-qubes``）。例如，"
"考慮一個 IP 為 ``10.137.0.100``、以 ``sys-firewall`` 作為 NetVM 的PV 應用程"
"式 qube ``work``。假設其 Xen 網域 ID 為任意值 ``12``，則 ``sys-firewall`` 中"
"位於 ``/rw/config/network-hooks.d/hook-100.sh`` 的以下腳本："

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:73
#: 817e7155955d49a39524bc30f36090d9
msgid ""
"will be executed with arguments ``online vif12.0 vif 10.137.0.100`` when "
"starting ``work``. Please note that in case of an HVM, the script will be "
"called twice - once with vif_type ``vif``, then with vif_type ``vif_ioemu`` "
"(and different interface names). As long as the ioemu interface exists, it "
"should be preferred (up to the hook script). When the VM decides to use a PV "
"interface (vif_type ``vif``), the ioemu one will be unplugged."
msgstr ""
"將在啟動 ``work`` 時使用參數 ``online vif12.0 vif 10.137.0.100`` 執行。請注"
"意，在 HVM 的情況下，腳本將被呼叫兩次——一次使用 vif_type ``vif``，然後使用 "
"vif_type ``vif_ioemu``（以及不同的介面名稱）。只要 ioemu 介面存在，就應該優先"
"使用（由掛鉤腳本決定）。當 VM 決定使用 PV 介面（vif_type ``vif``）時，ioemu "
"介面將被拔除。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:77
#: c513708bce6b4644ad63d12dd5200b76
msgid "Note that scripts need to be executable (``chmod +x``) to be used."
msgstr "請注意，腳本需要是可執行的（``chmod +x``）才能被使用。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:79
#: b18b6d28d71b482a9a2209d444c38ae8
msgid ""
"Also, take a look at :doc:`bind-dirs </user/advanced-topics/bind-dirs>` for "
"instructions on how to easily modify arbitrary system files in an app qube "
"and have those changes persist."
msgstr ""
"另請參閱 :doc:`bind-dirs </user/advanced-topics/bind-dirs>` 了解如何在應用程"
"式 qube中輕鬆修改任意系統檔案並使這些變更持久保存的說明。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:82
#: 2f81cce10d3648759c29cb0a30b00a36
msgid "GUI and audio configuration in dom0"
msgstr "dom0 中的 GUI 與音訊組態"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:85
#: 8a3c13818e524683929dcbbc617fc406
msgid ""
"The GUI configuration file ``/etc/qubes/guid.conf`` in one of a few not "
"managed by ``qubes-prefs`` or the Qubes Manager tool. Sample config "
"(included in default installation):"
msgstr ""
"GUI 組態檔 ``/etc/qubes/guid.conf`` 是少數不受 ``qubes-prefs`` 或 Qubes "
"Manager 工具管理的檔案之一。樣本組態（包含在預設安裝中）："

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:119
#: c5084ec810b04fa8a84e2bd3ef7a0f8c
msgid "Currently supported settings:"
msgstr "目前支援的設定："

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:121
#: 2e0b24626d844a03ad0ca8dd34a9905a
msgid ""
"``allow_fullscreen`` - allow VM to request its windows to go fullscreen "
"(without any colorful frame)."
msgstr "``allow_fullscreen`` - 允許 VM 請求其視窗進入全螢幕（沒有彩色邊框）。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:123
#: 83679ba8b9874d84be88bccb69e8f412
msgid ""
"**Note:** Regardless of this setting, you can always put a window into "
"fullscreen mode in Xfce4 using the trusted window manager by right-clicking "
"on a window’s title bar and selecting “Fullscreen”. This functionality "
"should still be considered safe, since a VM window still can’t voluntarily "
"enter fullscreen mode. The user must select this option from the trusted "
"window manager in dom0. To exit fullscreen mode from here, press ``alt`` + "
"``space`` to bring up the title bar menu again, then select “Leave "
"Fullscreen”."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 無論此設定如何，您始終可以透過在 Xfce4 中使用受信任的視窗管理器，"
"在視窗標題列上按右鍵並選擇「全螢幕」來將視窗置於全螢幕模式。此功能仍應被視為"
"安全的，因為 VM 視窗仍然無法自願進入全螢幕模式。使用者必須從 dom0 中受信任的"
"視窗管理器選擇此選項。若要從此處退出全螢幕模式，請按下 ``alt`` + ``space`` 再"
"次叫出標題列選單，然後選擇「離開全螢幕」。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:127
#: b311647defba4b27b3603332f8e057d1
msgid ""
"``allow_utf8_titles`` - allow the use of UTF-8 in window titles; otherwise, "
"non-ASCII characters are replaced by an underscore."
msgstr ""
"``allow_utf8_titles`` - 允許在視窗標題中使用 UTF-8；否則，非 ASCII 字元會被底"
"線取代。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:129
#: 75a59e3d3b7d48f597a4acd03167b084
msgid ""
"``secure_copy_sequence`` and ``secure_paste_sequence`` - key sequences used "
"to trigger secure copy and paste."
msgstr ""
"``secure_copy_sequence`` 和 ``secure_paste_sequence`` - 用於觸發安全複製和貼"
"上的按鍵序列。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:131
#: 0289006c25db4ca986ba6a781f38691a
msgid ""
"``audio_low_latency`` - force low-latency audio mode (about 40ms compared to "
"200-500ms by default). Note that this will cause much higher CPU usage in "
"dom0. It’s enabled by default, disabling it may save CPU in dom0."
msgstr ""
"``audio_low_latency`` - 強制低延遲音訊模式（約 40ms，預設為 200-500ms）。請注"
"意，這會導致 dom0 中 CPU 使用率大幅提高。它預設為啟用，停用它可能可以節省 "
"dom0 中的 CPU。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:133
#: 254585cd9c694e6dad88afe5e5bcb62b
msgid ""
"``trayicon_mode`` - defines the trayicon coloring mode. Options are - ``bg`` "
"- color full icon background to the VM color - ``border1`` - add 1px border "
"at the icon edges - ``border2`` - add 1px border 1px from the icon edges - "
"``tint`` - tinttint icon to the VM color, can be used with additional "
"modifiers (you can enable multiple of them) - ``tint+border1,tint+border2`` "
"- same as tint, but also add a border - ``tint+saturation50`` - same as "
"tint, but reduce icon saturation by 50% - ``tint+whitehack`` - same as tint, "
"but change white pixels (0xffffff) to almost-white (0xfefefe)"
msgstr ""
"``trayicon_mode`` - 定義系統匣圖示的著色模式。選項有 - ``bg`` - 將整個圖示背"
"景設為 VM 顏色 - ``border1`` - 在圖示邊緣新增 1px 邊框 - ``border2`` - 在距離"
"圖示邊緣 1px 處新增 1px 邊框 - ``tint`` - 將圖示染色為 VM 顏色，可與其他修飾"
"符一起使用（可啟用多個） - ``tint+border1,tint+border2`` - 與 tint 相同，但同"
"時新增邊框 - ``tint+saturation50`` - 與 tint 相同，但將圖示飽和度降低 50% - "
"``tint+whitehack`` - 與 tint 相同，但將白色像素（0xffffff）改為接近白色"
"（0xfefefe）"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:135
#: 9e2d64c039854df1ad54d821dc6ba90a
msgid ""
"``log level`` - defines the log options logs can take. It can have a value "
"of 0 (only errors), 1 (some basic messages), and 2 (debug)."
msgstr ""
"``log level`` - 定義日誌可以採用的日誌選項。它可以取值 0（僅錯誤）、1（一些基"
"本訊息）和 2（除錯）。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/config-files.rst:137
#: 9e71fbcba3db433e857d19b292fadd6a
msgid "``startup_timeout`` - The timeout for startup."
msgstr "``startup_timeout`` - 啟動的超時時間。"
